Preview release candidate packages
----------------------------------

The DogwoodSharp 0.1.0-preview.1 preview release candidate contains native
Dogwood bridge images and their manifests for win-x64, linux-x64, and
osx-arm64. The experimental DogwoodSharp.CedarSharp 0.1.0-experimental.1
package depends on that package and CedarSharp 1.0.0; it does not repackage
CedarSharp.

The native bridge is built from dogwood-policy/dogwood 1.1.2 at revision
929f49e7305534ac61ef06cf8e47269c596dc851 with Cedar 4.11.0. The applicable
Apache-2.0 license and upstream attribution remain in force. The external
CedarSharp 1.0.0 package and its three native images are consumed by exact
package and native hashes. Its native manifests declare a sourceCommit that is
not recoverable from the published repository; the package nuspec commit is
recoverable. No source reproducibility of the external CedarSharp native is
claimed.

This NOTICE is not represented as the complete resolved native dependency
license/notice inventory; a complete inventory must be collected and reviewed
before any distribution decision.

These packages are preview release candidates only. Their presence in a local
candidate directory or CI artifact is **not authorization to publish, sign,
tag, release, or distribute** them. Publication requires a separate explicit
owner authorization after the release-candidate verification and the
publication pipeline are accepted.

See docs/architecture/native-artifacts.md for the exact native identities and
docs/ci-publishing.md for the package gate.
